      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, you were able to combine the \"has been submitted\" and \"has emulated signal\" into a single waitable `std::shared_future`? \n\nI think this is okay but still thinking through it and wanted to check in first.\n\nIf so, I think we should rename these to encapsulate that this is covering both the \"has been submitted\" and \"has emulated signal\" into something that covers both (maybe just `isWaitable`?) and document here with something like\n\n```\n// 1. Handles races between the main virtio gpu channel and RenderThread/ASG\n// channels by ensuring that the host does not do a `vkWaitForFences()` before \n// the fence is used in a `VkQueueSubmit`.\n//\n// 2. Allows the host to insert additional operations and artificially delay when\n// the fence will be marked as signaled (e.g. inserting VK-\u003eGL ColorBuffer syncs\n// after vkQueueSubmit() operations).\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 293,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 294,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "8653c1e8a2e1b9819281f3cb71caf59607b02586",
